# Portfolio platform core

- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for commands and runtime (host vs Docker).
- Read [.github/copilot-instructions.md](.github/copilot-instructions.md) before implementing in `src/`.
- **Primary goal:** PySpark + lakehouse learning — include a short **Lead takeaway** after substantive changes.
- **Spark:** Use `IcebergCatalog().get_spark_session()` from `src/iceberg/catalog.py`; never duplicate catalog/S3A config.
- **Tickers:** Uppercase symbols (`AAPL`).
- **Scripts:** Prefer existing `scripts/*.sh` wrappers over new one-off shell.
- **Skills:** Use `.cursor/skills/` runbooks when the task matches (analytics, pipeline verify, debug, design, ETL, export).
